From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: owner <owner@localhost>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:05:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 08/11] Taviri: grokbot: fields are settings too
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Custom fields named `taviri:…` or `grokbot:…` hold settings (recipes,
item icons) and are never typed into pages or offered as extra fields,
the same rule as the Taviri connector 0.3.3.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
